// Purpose:
// This is the MudOS master object.
// This is the second object loaded after simul_efun.c.
// Everything written with 'write()' at startup will be printed on stdout.
// 1. create() will be called first.
// 2. epilog() will be called.
// 3. The game will enter multiuser mode, and enable log in.
//
// Original from TMI-2 and ES2
// Rewritten by Falcon 96-10-02
// nerd: add support for lpscript & http.
// nerd: add support for auto reboot 98-08-30 : Removed for some reason.
// nerd: add support for ftp.  98-10-02

